<noinclude>
A launcher-tile grid for the time tracker. Drop it on any page (the wiki's Main Page is the natural home):

  {{Dashboard}}

The tiles are rendered by the {{#timetracker_dashboard:}} parser function (raw HTML, because MediaWiki's wikitext
sanitizer strips the <code><nowiki><a></nowiki></code> tags a fully-clickable tile needs). That parser function also
loads the tile styling (the <code>ext.timetracker.dashboard</code> module shipped by the extension), so this template
is just the call.
[[Category:Time tracker templates]]
